    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "professional help just feels like more noise. more talking, more explaining, more people trying to \"fix\" me while I'm just drowning in it all. it doesn't change the fact that the world is just too loud and i'm too tired. i don't want to \"manage\" it anymore. i just want the noise to stop. is there any way to just... get to that absolute stillness? once and for all?",
